(g) Disclosing the proceedings of a public sitting, meeting or session held by a board, committee or other similar body established under the authority of a law and operating under the law, for the purpose of disclosing those proceedings, without adding to or omitting from what took place;

(h) Disclosing the proceedings, without bias towards any particular party, based on the deliberations held at an international conference held openly or at a meeting of an international organisation, for the purpose of disclosing those proceedings, without adding to or omitting from what took place;

(i) Disclosing, as it stands and without addition or omission, expressions contained in a document made public at an international conference, meeting or session, or published as public information on behalf of an international organisation, or part of such document, for the purpose of disclosing them;

